The Fleet release archives contain the runtime, an installer and
local documentation. They do not contain a managed service, a desktop app,
provider CLI packages, credentials or a paid licensing module. Agent CLIs
are installed separately by the user.

The runtime currently declares no production npm dependencies. See
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md for the dependency inventory shipped with the archive.
Fleet uses Node.js platform cryptography, including Ed25519 audit signatures.
Windows-only code can use the Windows Data Protection API for local secrets;
that code is not a bundled cryptographic library.
